    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="7" relname="span">I just wanted to know where you got the five second rule for downloading graphics.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="elaboration">I was just wondering whether it was a "standard" or whether it was your own rule of thumb.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="7" relname="evaluation">Either way it is reasonable and realistic to the expectations of most online users.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="5" relname="joint">I concur with your pointing out that a website should provide options for the level of usability from novice to experienced users.</segment>
        <group id="5" type="multinuc"/>
        <group id="6" type="span" parent="5" relname="joint"/>
        <group id="7" type="span" parent="6" relname="span"/>
    </body>
